LICENSING SCOPE

Original contributions

Graeme L. Hickey dedicates his original package code and documentation under CC0 1.0 Universal, to the extent of his copyright and related rights in those contributions. No attribution condition is imposed by that dedication, and reuse, modification, and redistribution are permitted, including for commercial purposes.

The CC0 1.0 Universal legal terms apply:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

Third-party materials

The third-party datasets in data/, the original data files and codebooks under data-raw/edition1/ and data-raw/edition2/, and their underlying content are excluded from the CC0 dedication. They are sourced from:
https://github.com/graemeleehickey/hosmer-lemeshow
commit 59a56c509c81898d3853763afcf71686234a1326.

The source repository identifies the Wiley companion data site as the original download location:
https://ftp.wiley.com/public/sci_tech_med/survival/

UCLA provides freely downloadable second-edition data in SAS and SPSS formats, with analysis examples for Stata, SPSS, and SAS:
https://stats.oarc.ucla.edu/other/examples/asa2/

No explicit dataset licence is supplied in the source repository. Availability for download does not itself establish redistribution terms. Existing third-party rights remain with their respective holders; this package neither grants those rights nor imposes additional restrictions on those materials. Nothing in this notice restricts uses that do not require permission under applicable law.
